.
*   Normal force (N) is a force, so it also has dimensions [MLT^-2. However, it is often a force perpendicular to a surface, and is related to the force of gravity (W = Mg) where g is acceleration due to gravity. In this specific direction, it can be expressed as a force per unit length.

