We are given that the $y$ coordinate of the midpoint is -1, so $\frac{4}{m} = -1$, which means $m = -4$.
The equation of the line $L$ is $y = -4(x-4)$, so $y = -4x + 16$, or $4x + y - 16 = 0$.

