$$\frac{ab^2}{ab^{-2}} = \frac{1}{6} \Rightarrow b^{2 - (-2)} = \frac{1}{6} \Rightarrow b^4 = \frac{1}{6} \Rightarrow b = \sqrt[4]{\frac{1}{6}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt[4]{6}} = 6^{-1/4}$
