*   T = 37°C = 310.15 K
*   [ATP] = [ADP] = [Pi] = 1 mm = 1 x 10⁻³ M

**2. Calculating the Standard  ΔG (ΔG°) for the Reaction at Standard Conditions**

The standard ΔG for a reaction is the change in G when all reactants and products are at 1 M  *  
