*   k_1 = 10<sup>-1
    
*   1/T_1 = 0.0018 K⁻¹
*   k_2 = 10⁴
*   1/T_2 = 0.0012 K⁻1
*   R = 2  cal K⁻¹ mol⁻¹

Now, substitute these values into the equation:

ln(10⁴ / 10⁻¹) = - (E_a / 2) * (0.0012 - 0.0018)

ln(10⁵) = - (E_a / 2) * (-0.0006)

